---
---
<header class="opening relative min-h-[100svh] flex flex-col justify-center overflow-clip" style="padding:0 var(--gutter)">
  <div class="opening__mist absolute inset-0 -z-10 will-change-transform" data-parallax="0.25" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="opening__scrim absolute inset-0 -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <p class="opening__eyebrow" data-reveal><span class="text-vermilion mr-[0.6em]" aria-hidden="true">&#9679;</span>Catatan tebing</p>
  <h1 class="opening__title" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.1s">Sang <em>Penjaga</em> Gunung</h1>
  <p class="opening__sub" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.2s">Ia berjalan di atas lautan awan. Kami berdiri di bawahnya, dan <em class="text-mist">langit tidak lagi terasa jauh.</em></p>
  <p class="opening__mark" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.3s"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Dua orang melihatnya dari tebing</p>

  <div class="scroll-hint absolute bottom-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-mist" style="right:var(--gutter)" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="[writing-mode:vertical-rl] text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Naiklah</span>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .opening__mist{
    background-image:url("/assets/mist-band.jpg");
    background-size:cover; background-position:center 72%;
    opacity:.5;
    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 34%, #000 78%);
            mask-image:linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 34%, #000 78%);
  }
  .opening__scrim{
    background:linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(13,20,18,.72) 0%, rgba(13,20,18,.28) 45%, transparent 70%);
  }
  .opening__eyebrow{
    font-size:.8rem; letter-spacing:.28em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--color-sage); margin-bottom:1.6rem;
  }
  .opening__title{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:300;
    font-size:clamp(3.2rem, 11vw, 9rem);
    line-height:.96; letter-spacing:-0.015em;
    max-width:9ch;
  }
  .opening__title em{ font-style:italic; color:var(--color-mist) }
  .opening__sub{
    margin-top:2rem; max-width:32ch;
    font-size:clamp(1.05rem, 1rem + 0.5vw, 1.35rem);
    color:var(--color-ink-dim);
  }
  .opening__mark{
    margin-top:3rem;
    font-size:.85rem; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--color-ink-dim);
  }
  .opening__mark i{
    display:inline-block; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid var(--color-vermilion);
    box-shadow:0 0 14px 2px rgba(200,68,44,.45);
    margin-right:.9em;
  }
  .opening__mark i + i{ margin-left:-.35em }
  .scroll-hint{
    padding-bottom:max(1.25rem, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  }
  .scroll-hint::before{
    content:""; width:1px; height:4.5rem;
    background:linear-gradient(transparent, var(--color-mist));
  }
  .scroll-hint::after{
    content:""; width:9px; height:9px;
    border-right:1.5px solid var(--color-mist); border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--color-mist);
    transform:rotate(45deg);
    animation:hint-dip 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes hint-dip{
    0%,100%{ transform:rotate(45deg) translate(0,0) }
    50%{ transform:rotate(45deg) translate(4px,4px) }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .scroll-hint::after{ animation:none }
    .opening__mist{ transform:none !important }
  }
</style>
